%% Simplified overview for the guide
flowchart LR
    U[User + Role] -->|operates| P
    M[Merchant] -->|customer pays| P[Payment]
    S[SwitchDatabase\nrouting to bank] --- P
    P -->|every state change| PE[PaymentEvent\naudit trail]
    P -->|capture / refund| J[JournalEntry]
    J --> PO[Posting\ndebit/credit] --> A[Account\nledger]
    B[Bank sends] --> SF[SettlementFile] --> SR[SettlementRecord]
    SR -->|settlement posting| J
    SR --> RR
    P --> RR[ReconciliationRun]
    RR --> RS[ReconciliationResult\nMATCHED / MISMATCH / MISSING / DUPLICATE]
